    "Id": "Gear_Armor_Hardened_Peel_N_Stick_QS",
    "Name": "Hardened Peel 'n Stick",
    "Details": "Quicsell Hardened Peel 'n Stick™ Armor\n\nThe latest advancement in Quicsell's patented Peel 'n Stick™ armor technology! Hardened Peel 'n Stick™ is heavier, tougher, and—most importantly—appears to repair itself continuously after taking damage.\n\nExactly how it does this remains a subject of ongoing research. The armor seems to spontaneously replace damaged material, even when no replacement material is available. Our engineers have several theories, none of which have survived peer review. Please do not ask where the extra armor comes from.\n\nUnfortunately, the hardened compound is considerably heavier, meaning slightly less total armor can be applied. The material also produces minor interference with targeting systems, resulting in reduced weapon accuracy. This is completely normal and probably not a safety concern.\n\nBut who cares about a little accuracy when your armor is busy fixing itself?\n\nQuicsell Hardened Peel 'n Stick™ — It takes a licking and keeps sticking.",
    "Icon": "shieldcomb"
  },
